<title>CANADA: Loblaw Cos Ltd Q3 Oct 5 net profit edges up.</title>
<headline>Loblaw Cos Ltd Q3 Oct 5 net profit edges up.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3 ended Oct 5</p>
<p>				1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.19		   C$0.16</p>
<p> Net			 45,500		   38,600</p>
<p> Revs		   3,070,100		2,866,500</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.47		   C$0.40</p>
<p> Net			113,800		   97,400</p>
<p> Revs		   7,463,900		7,629,500</p>
<p>		 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Just about all of the assets of the United States retail business were sold at the end of 1995's second quarter for a pre-tax gain of C$4.8 million. Also, per common share amounts were adjusted to reflect a three-for-one share split approved by shareholders on April 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Lydia Zajc, Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
